OL,3,GNEWSARider warns of out-of-control dogs
OL,4,Ayear on from fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA horse rider is calling for more
OL,7,Fresponsible dog ownership after she
OL,8,Fsuffered serious injuries falling from
OL,9,Fher horse when it was chased by an
OL,10,Fout-of-control dog.
OL,12,FMarie Vickers, 46, from Ringwood,
OL,13,FHampshire was riding in the New Forest
OL,14,Fin October 2025 when her horse bolted
OL,15,Finto woods after being startled by the
OL,16,Fdog, and she came off at "high speed".
OL,18,FShe suffered severe injuries in the
OL,19,Ffall and was taken to hospital where
OL,20,Fshe underwent emergency surgery and
OL,21,Fspent six days in intensive care.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
